{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Lulla 是一款專為父母設計的嬰兒睡眠輔助 App，提供豐富的白噪音、自然聲響及搖籃曲，幫助寶寶建立健康的作息習慣。這款應用目前正限時免費，讓家長能以零成本獲得專業級的哄睡工具，輕鬆應對新生兒至幼兒階段的各種入睡挑戰。</p>\n\n<h2>多元聲音與智能混音</h2>\n<p>App 內置白噪音、心跳聲及雨聲等多種高品質音效，支援無縫循環播放。用戶可自由混合多種聲音並調整個別音量，創建專屬的睡眠場景。此外，它還配備睡眠計時器、漸弱播放功能及夜燈模式，並支援離線使用，確保在任何環境下都能為寶寶營造安寧舒適的睡眠氛圍。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-42-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-43-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-44-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-45-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-46-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Lulla: Baby Sleep Sounds</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T19:24:02.030416+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}